    "body_html": "<ol>\n<li><p>Leave a comment below to introduce yourself! You can talk about what brought you here, what you're learning, or just a fun fact about<br>\nyourself.</p></li>\n<li><p>Reply to someone's comment, either with a question or just a hello. 👋</p></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F4spgvxld1y7o9cgfcwv0.gif\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F4spgvxld1y7o9cgfcwv0.gif\" alt=\"Character Mr. Dink from the TV show Doug stops mowing the lawn to wave and say \" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\"></a></p>\n\n<p>Come back next week to greet our new members so you can one day earn our <a href=\"https://dev.to/community-badges?badge=warm-welcome\">Warm Welcome Badge</a></p>\n\n",
    "body_markdown": "1. Leave a comment below to introduce yourself! You can talk about what brought you here, what you're learning, or just a fun fact about\nyourself.\n\n2. Reply to someone's comment, either with a question or just a hello. 👋\n\n![Character Mr. Dink from the TV show Doug stops mowing the lawn to wave and say \"Bonjour, welcome, newcomer.\"](https://media.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPWVjZjA1ZTQ3NnlyMDdrMWhjNXJ4ZmM4bjJzYXRmbzYxOG8xbnNjdzB2ZWR3YnoxMCZlcD12MV9naWZzX3NlYXJjaCZjdD1n/26Ffk99hs5WtggmIw/giphy.gif)\n\nCome back next week to greet our new members so you can one day earn our [Warm Welcome Badge](https://dev.to/community-badges?badge=warm-welcome)\n",
